`ctx.textToSpeech`. Cordis service names are global, so this package uses `ctx.ttsService` and both can run side by
side. We will then publish a major version that:

@loveandbeepbrother/dsh-tts-service README · When DSH ships its own `textToSpeech` service：1. registers the three providers on the upstream service, keeping capabilities the upstream provider interface lacks
   (tone descriptions, context, voice listing) as extensions until upstream adds them;
2. makes the tools and outputs call the upstream service;
